1
00:00:06,083 --> 00:00:08,793
(Sheldon:)And good evening to you, Siam Palace.

2
00:00:08,961 --> 00:00:10,341
(Sheldon:)This is Sheldon Cooper.

3
00:00:10,504 --> 00:00:12,584
(Sheldon:)I'm going to be dining alone
this evening...

4
00:00:12,756 --> 00:00:14,966
(Sheldon:)...so I'll be reducing my usual order.

5
00:00:15,134 --> 00:00:19,594
(Sheldon:)I'd like to start with one quarter
of the Assorted Appetizers Plate...

6
00:00:19,763 --> 00:00:23,643
...and one half
of the Golden Treasure for two--

7
00:00:23,809 --> 00:00:26,809
(Sheldon:)Oh, for heaven's sake.
In the mid-18th century...

8
00:00:26,979 --> 00:00:29,939
(Sheldon:)...King Rama IV of Siam
divided a huge empire...

9
00:00:30,107 --> 00:00:33,447
(Sheldon:)...amongst the colonial powers of Europe
to preserve his throne.

10
00:00:33,610 --> 00:00:37,990
(Sheldon:)Surely you, his cultural descendant,
can handle pad thai and dumplings.

11
00:00:38,157 --> 00:00:39,737
PENNY:
Sheldon, help!

12
00:00:39,908 --> 00:00:41,698
(Sheldon:)I need to go, but you keep in mind...

13
00:00:41,869 --> 00:00:44,249
(Sheldon:)...that my sharply worded comments
on Yelp.com...

14
00:00:44,413 --> 00:00:46,493
(Sheldon:)...recently took down
a local muffin store.

15
00:00:50,127 --> 00:00:52,967
Penny. Penny. Penny.

16
00:00:53,130 --> 00:00:55,170
PENNY:
Come in! Hurry!

17
00:00:55,340 --> 00:00:57,260
[SHOWER RUNNING]

18
00:00:57,426 --> 00:01:03,026
(Sheldon:)-Penny?
PENNY: I'm back here.

